diff --git a/skills/advisory-board/references/epistemics.md b/skills/advisory-board/references/epistemics.md
index d00dbf4..d6cb731 100644
--- a/skills/advisory-board/references/epistemics.md
+++ b/skills/advisory-board/references/epistemics.md
